src/kql.pest is a pest grammar derived from the Kusto Query Language parser in
Kusto.Language (https://github.com/microsoft/Kusto-Query-Language, commit
7e658f73457320fea8fde24c5f1b5a7e2a87ca59), Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The grammar follows the
expression precedence and operator families of
src/Kusto.Language/Parser/QueryParser.cs, the operator parameters of
src/Kusto.Language/QueryOperatorParameters.cs and the literal forms of
src/Kusto.Language/Parser/TokenParser.cs. No source code was copied; the
grammar is a translation into pest notation and covers a subset of KQL.

